      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而皇冠小姐则会作为气氛担当，\n很自然地把大家都带动起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ceb386d41894406407720d60c6d04e3e7875fa7db332ec4c625d6c56bf0a895",
