      "uid": "zhcn:f479deeb8063853c354f0b00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至于我们没注意到的地方，\n则总是由高尚稳稳地补上。\n这种配合啊，顺手得有点不可思议呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c676251f408a3ab2129226f7eea9e6dba5fbaa7100f147377db131204426fb3f",
