    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd68fc0c138ed53984120ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说同步……也许更像是“衔接得很好”？\n就像一开始，大家就已经自然站到了\n最适合自己的位置上——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7ed69157535f5e9fda109f4855112a1c2ea0ed97d914ce4c40506d318e6dc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089802.json",
